      "content": "A wave of issue reports has been submitted to various Windows 12 simulator projects. Developers have traced many of the reports to automated senders, outdated forks, and users running modified builds. The maintainers recommend verifying simulator integrity, clearing cached assets, and ensuring that the simulator is running the latest stable HTML+JS build. Community maintainers have also introduced new validation tools to help identify false or duplicated issue senders.",
